    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy Pomodoro timer that gently keeps you on track.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay on track. Literally.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/0820ca266ac8ba3531b3068579fb71ea.poster.avif?t=1751992428\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/0820ca266ac8ba3531b3068579fb71ea.webm?t=1751992428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/0820ca266ac8ba3531b3068579fb71ea.mp4?t=1751992428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PomoExpress turns your focus sessions into tranquil train rides. Watch the scenery roll by as you work, rest, and repeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Pomodoro Cycles Covered</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/3c8bb2cfa6fe444c855a8e8cecb3b5e7.poster.avif?t=1751992428\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/3c8bb2cfa6fe444c855a8e8cecb3b5e7.webm?t=1751992428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/3c8bb2cfa6fe444c855a8e8cecb3b5e7.mp4?t=1751992428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes focus sessions, short breaks, and long breaks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work to Collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/fbad063668d2274230cdeae9326b2676.poster.avif?t=1751992428\" width=750 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/fbad063668d2274230cdeae9326b2676.webm?t=1751992428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/fbad063668d2274230cdeae9326b2676.mp4?t=1751992428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new trains, carriages, and scenic backdrops simply by staying focused.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Track Your Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/e0053b2731e08aba5346ca2a1a280082.poster.avif?t=1751992428\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/e0053b2731e08aba5346ca2a1a280082.webm?t=1751992428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/e0053b2731e08aba5346ca2a1a280082.mp4?t=1751992428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View daily stats and your completed sessions at a glance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Day &amp; Night</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/ebf77f286249b5ca115f11f8e3ccb525.poster.avif?t=1751992428\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/ebf77f286249b5ca115f11f8e3ccb525.webm?t=1751992428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/ebf77f286249b5ca115f11f8e3ccb525.mp4?t=1751992428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun and moon follow your system clock, bringing life to your journey.</p>",
